{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 89,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "89:1",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "By the dawn",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:2",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And [by] ten nights",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:3",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And [by] the even [number] and the odd",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:4",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "And [by] the night when it passes,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:5",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "Is there [not] in [all] that an oath [sufficient] for one of perception?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:6",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "Have you not considered how your Lord dealt with ʿAad -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:7",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "[With] Iram - who had lofty pillars,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:8",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "The likes of whom had never been created in the land?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:9",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "And [with] Thamūd, who carved out the rocks in the valley?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:10",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "And [with] Pharaoh, owner of the stakes?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:11",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "[All of] whom oppressed within the lands",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:12",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "And increased therein the corruption.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:13",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "So your Lord poured upon them a scourge of punishment.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:14",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "Indeed, your Lord is in observation.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:15",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "And as for man, when his Lord tries him and [thus] is generous to him and favors him, he says, \"My Lord has honored me.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:16",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "But when He tries him and restricts his provision, he says, \"My Lord has humiliated me.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:17",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "No! But you do not honor the orphan",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:18",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "And you do not encourage one another to feed the poor.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:19",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "And you consume inheritance, devouring [it] altogether,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:20",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "And you love wealth with immense love.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:21",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "No! When the earth has been leveled - pounded and crushed",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:22",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "And your Lord has come and the angels, rank upon rank,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:23",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "And brought [within view], that Day, is Hell - that Day, man will remember, but how [i.e., what good] to him will be the remembrance?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:24",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "He will say, \"Oh, I wish I had sent ahead [some good] for my life.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:25",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "So on that Day, none will punish [as severely] as His punishment,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:26",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "And none will bind [as severely] as His binding [of the evildoers].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:27",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "[To the righteous it will be said], \"O reassured soul,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:28",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "Return to your Lord, well-pleased and pleasing [to Him],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:29",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "And enter among My [righteous] servants",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "89:30",
      "surahNumber": 89,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "And enter My Paradise.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
